[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_4_0_BREEZE_OF_DEATH]
Breeze of Death

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_4_0_BREEZE_OF_DEATH_DESC]
No fortress can’t be destroyed, only speed can’t be broken. Let the army move through the enemy like a breeze, let them turn their tranquil dreams into eternal sleep.

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_4_0_BREEZE_OF_DEATH_desc]


[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_4_0_BREEZE_OF_DEATH]
死亡之风

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_4_0_BREEZE_OF_DEATH_DESC]
无坚不摧，唯快不破。让军队像疾风一样穿行于敌阵之中，让他们在宁静的睡梦中迎接自己的永眠。

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_4_0_BREEZE_OF_DEATH_desc]
